>
>
>
> This is due to the fact that sometimes there is no likelihood for some combinations of index i,j,t and I need to skip them. From previous discussions I understand that this should be fine (alternative to conditional 'for' loop (google.com) <https://groups.google.com/g/nimble-users/c/VONLhKKaYko/m/UjBu1b6vBAAJ>) but maybe this causes some issues…
